    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="2" relname="antithesis">Speaking of learn ability, I hope I dont sound like and ad,</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="21" relname="span">but turbotax.com has been a lifesaver.</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="15" relname="concession">I work with taxes in my job</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="15" relname="span">and I still sometimes find it to be a daunting task to complete them</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="4" relname="elaboration">and paying someone to do them seems out of the question.</segment>
        <segment id="6" parent="18" relname="span">Turbo Tax has a great online program that walks you through step by step completing your taxes.</segment>
        <segment id="7" parent="6" relname="evidence">I was able to do my taxes last year with a tuition reduction, getting credit for the interest paid on my student loans and taking a distribution from a retirement plan.</segment>
        <segment id="8" parent="17" relname="conjunction">The website itself, as well as the built in application, is incredibly easy to navigate</segment>
        <segment id="9" parent="17" relname="conjunction">and it makes what would probably take hours to do by paper, easy to complete in minutes.</segment>
        <segment id="10" parent="16" relname="conjunction">There was virtually no learning curve to the software</segment>
        <segment id="11" parent="16" relname="conjunction">and best of all; it made something likes taxes with deductions, which is not always easy, fairly simple.</segment>
        <group id="12" type="span"/>
        <group id="13" type="span" parent="12" relname="span"/>
        <group id="14" type="span" parent="13" relname="span"/>
        <group id="15" type="span" parent="20" relname="span"/>
        <group id="16" type="multinuc" parent="19" relname="evidence"/>
        <group id="17" type="multinuc" parent="18" relname="evidence"/>
        <group id="18" type="span" parent="19" relname="span"/>
        <group id="19" type="span" parent="14" relname="span"/>
        <group id="20" type="span" parent="14" relname="solutionhood"/>
        <group id="21" type="span" parent="13" relname="background"/>
    </body>
